                <pb facs="0479" n="391" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg391"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and Haiti extending the time within which may
                    be effected the exchange of ratifications of the treaty of naturalization
                    between the two countries, signed March 22, 1902</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, February 28, 1908.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, February 1, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by the President,
                        March 17, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by Haiti, April 24, 1903.<lb/>Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, March 19, 1904.<lb/>Proclaimed, March 24,
                        1904.</hi></p>

                <xi:include href="ch94/d364.xml" xpointer="d364"/>
